 steps will reproduce the problem?\r\n\r\nI'm trying to use the inbuilt `IpHelper` class for checking IP addresses are in the given range or not. My range is `2620:0:2d0:200::7/32` and the IP I want to check is `2620:0:0:0:0:0:0:0`.\r\n\r\n### What is the expected result?\r\n\r\nThe `2620:0:0:0:0:0:0:0` is the start range of the `2620:0:2d0:200::7/32` so it should contain it, the result should be `true`.\r\n\r\n### What do you get instead?\r\n\r\n```php\r\nvar_dump(\\yii\\helpers\\IpHelper::inRange('2620:0:0:0:0:0:0:0', '2620:0:2d0:200::7/32')); // bool(false)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Additional info\r\n\r\nChecked Symfony and Java version, both gives true result for this range and address.\r\n\r\n```php\r\nvar_dump(\\Symfony\\Component\\HttpFoundation\\IpUtils::checkIp('2620:0:0:0:0:0:0:0', '2620:0:2d0:200::7/32')); // bool(true)\r\n```\r\nFor java: https://seancfoley.github.io/IPAddress/\r\n```java\r\nimport inet.ipaddr.IPAddressString;\r\n\r\npublic class Main {\r\n    public static void main(String [] args) {\r\n        final boolean result = matches(\"2620:0:0:0:0:0:0:0\",\"2620:0:2d0:200::7/32\");\r\n        System.out.println(String.format(\"Result: %s\", result ? \"match\" : \"not match\")); // \"match\"\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private static boolean matches(String ip, String subnet) {\r\n        IPAddressString one = new IPAddressString(subnet);\r\n        IPAddressString two = new IPAddressString(ip);\r\n        return one.getAddress().contains(two.getAddress());\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n| Q                | A\r\n| ---------------- | ---\r\n| Yii version      | 2.0.15.1\r\n| PHP version      | 7.2.19\r\n| Operating system | Ubuntu 18.04.3 LTS\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"SilverFire","id":4499203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTkyMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4499203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverFire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/17508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/17508/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}